---
source: tests/golden.rs
---
  x something sits between `renovate` and `version`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-asset/modules/core/pins/module.kdl:11:9]
 10 |         manual "someone watches the release feed"
 11 |         version "1.0.0"
    :         ^^^|^^^
    :            `-- has to be the line directly below `renovate`
 12 |         url "https://example.com/download/v{version}/tool.tar.gz"
    `----
  help: Renovate matches the two together, so anything between them stops the
        pin being tracked, silently

  x the pin is declared `renovate` and `manual`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-asset/modules/core/pins/module.kdl:10:9]
  9 |         renovate datasource="github-releases" depName="owner/repo"
 10 |         manual "someone watches the release feed"
    :         ^^^|^^
    :            `-- pick one
 11 |         version "1.0.0"
    `----
  help: `renovate datasource="github-tags" depName="owner/repo"`, or `manual
        "why nothing tracks it"`

  x the pin has a malformed sha256
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-asset/modules/core/pins/module.kdl:8:5]
 7 | asset "tracked-and-manual" {
 8 |     pin {
   :     ^|^
   :      `-- not 64 hex digits
 9 |         renovate datasource="github-releases" depName="owner/repo"
   `----
  help: sha256sum output, lowercase

  x the pin says nothing about how it is kept current
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-asset/modules/core/pins/module.kdl:18:5]
 17 | asset "no-tracking" {
 18 |     pin {
    :     ^|^
    :      `-- needs `renovate` or `manual`
 19 |         version "1.0.0"
    `----
  help: `renovate datasource="github-tags" depName="owner/repo"`, or `manual
        "why nothing tracks it"`

  x the pin declares no `sha256`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-asset/modules/core/pins/module.kdl:18:5]
 17 | asset "no-tracking" {
 18 |     pin {
    :     ^|^
    :      `-- nothing to verify what arrived
 19 |         version "1.0.0"
    `----
  help: every downloaded asset is verified against its pin; one whose url is a
        git repository is cloned at the commit or tag its version names
        instead, and declares none

  x the URL has an unknown placeholder {tag}
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-asset/modules/core/pins/module.kdl:18:5]
 17 | asset "no-tracking" {
 18 |     pin {
    :     ^|^
    :      `-- not substituted
 19 |         version "1.0.0"
    `----
  help: a URL template expands `{version}` and nothing else
